WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.165 --> 00:00:04.670
[ENGINE SOUNDS]

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:06.210
LEWIS HAMILTON:
When I was four, five years old,

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:07.605
I either wanted to be Superman

00:00:07.605 --> 00:00:10.410
or I wanted to be a Formula
One world champion.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:13.170
When my visor comes down,
that's when my mind definitely

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:16.350
switches to a different
capacity, and it's high-octane.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:21.620
As an athlete, I'm always
looking how I can be better.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:25.584
I'm going to be talking to you about

00:00:25.584 --> 00:00:26.800
mental preparation,

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.590
how you can be laser-focused,
and have more energy.

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:31.960
How you can feel healthier,
because the better you feel,

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:33.190
the better you are
at doing your job.

00:00:34.696 --> 00:00:36.453
You might already be successful.

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:38.240
Killing it in whatever you're doing

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:40.124
but I can help you be better.

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:44.904
My mastery is not the ability
to put the car on the limit.

00:00:44.904 --> 00:00:46.720
[ENGINE ROARING]

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:48.606
It's mastering my emotions

00:00:48.606 --> 00:00:49.720
and understanding

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:51.042
how to live into my potential.

00:00:51.042 --> 00:00:53.209
[TIRES SCREECHING]

00:00:53.690 --> 00:00:56.020
I will show you what is possible.

00:00:56.804 --> 00:00:58.829
This is MasterClass.

